{"publicId":"d4fc6191-fb33-4488-90b7-f1302f3b2bba","title":"Injective关联转账代理商获SEC注册，专注证券持有记录","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-17T07:48:36.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-17T07:48:36.000Z","digest":"Injective宣布其关联转账代理商Injective Institutional Services, LLC已获美国证券交易委员会（SEC）注册，该实体主要负责证券持有记录的官方管理，与区块链技术本身无直接关联【新】。\n\nSEC备案文件显示，该注册机构的核心职能是处理证券持有证明的合规性记录，而非对Injective区块链技术或智能合约进行监管或认证。此前Injective已在2023年获得SEC批准的证券交易服务资质，此次注册被视为其合规业务扩展的一部分【新】。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-17T08:55:13.139Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Injective宣布关联转账代理商已获SEC注册","latestReport":{"id":"jyvxx4rv4glso5vb0hzjuina3"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":false,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"f9rR4CA9T5yo","title":"SEC注册","firstReportAt":"2026-11-17T07:48:36.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"jyvxx4rv4glso5vb0hzjuina3","title":"Injective宣布关联转账代理商已获SEC注册","summary":"Injective宣布其关联转账代理商Injective Institutional Services, LLC已获SEC注册。SEC文件显示该实体负责证券持有记录，与区块链技术本身无关。","source":{"name":"The Defiant","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T07:48:36.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"jyvxx4rv4glso5vb0hzjuina3","title":"Injective宣布关联转账代理商已获SEC注册","summary":"Injective宣布其关联转账代理商Injective Institutional Services, LLC已获SEC注册。SEC文件显示该实体负责证券持有记录，与区块链技术本身无关。","source":{"name":"The Defiant","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T07:48:36.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-17T09:00:00.000Z","heat":9.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T10:00:00.000Z","heat":9.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T11:00:00.000Z","heat":9.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T12:00:00.000Z","heat":8.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T13:00:00.000Z","heat":8.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T14:00:00.000Z","heat":8.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T15:00:00.000Z","heat":8.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T16:00:00.000Z","heat":7.9,"part